      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Core Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the specific provider I'll be targeting. The objective now is to structure the Python code within the `select_platform_resource.py` file to effectively identify and manage Vertex AI resources prior to their use. I intend to make the provider identity explicit within the code.\n\n\n**Implementing Resource Resolution**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the resource resolution logic within `select_platform_resource.py`. The plan is to create `resolve_model_resource` and `resolve_endpoint_resource` functions. These functions will accept project ID, location, and either model or endpoint IDs, then use `google.cloud.aiplatform` to construct and return the resource names. This is where I'm putting the actual Vertex AI implementation.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862048363,
          "start": 1789862046816
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc176c60001Yc1QGFm9Qkp1rJ",
